{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-12-01-how-to-create-ordered-and-unordered-list-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To create ordered and unordered list in react js, you have to use the  tag in ordered and the  tag used in unordered. It…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To create ordered and unordered list in react js, you have to use the <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ol></code> tag in ordered and the <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ul></code> tag used in unordered. It will create ordered and unordered lists in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to create ordered and unordered list in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"./App.css\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ol className=\"ordered-list\"></code> and <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ul className=\"unordered-list\"></code> to create ordered and unordered list in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Ordered Tech Stack<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>ol className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"ordered-list\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>techStack<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">tech<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> index</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n          <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>li key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tech<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>li<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>ol<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Unordered Hobbies<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>ul className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"unordered-list\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hobbies<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">hobby<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> index</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n          <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>li key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hobby<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>li<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>ul<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Create ordered and unordered list example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">react</code> and use <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ol></code> tag in ordered and the <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ul></code> tag used in unordered to create ordered and unordered list in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"./App.css\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">StyledLists</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> techStack <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"React\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"JavaScript\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"CSS\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> hobbies <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Reading\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Gaming\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Traveling\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Ordered Tech Stack<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>ol className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"ordered-list\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>techStack<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">tech<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> index</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n          <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>li key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tech<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>li<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>ol<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Unordered Hobbies<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h2<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>ul className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"unordered-list\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hobbies<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">hobby<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> index</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n          <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>li key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hobby<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>li<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>ul<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> StyledLists<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.css</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.ordered-list</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">list-style-type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> decimal<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Numbers for ordered list */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 10px 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">padding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0 20px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.unordered-list</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">list-style-type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> disc<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Bullets for unordered list */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 10px 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">padding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0 20px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">li</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 5px 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Space between items */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">font-size</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 16px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #333<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Text color */</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ol></code> and <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ul></code> to create ordered and unordered list in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 390px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2aec5ce02a2f50ca226aab2a7382e464/a9b47/ordered-and-unordered-list.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 108.86075949367088%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmQAAABXRUJQVlA4IFgAAADQAwCdASoUABYAPtFUoUwoJKMiMBgMAQAaCWUAAC5/sicjEPAATAAA3mfQUJ5oCOnTicToqqkCVpzu0w1RutHzF3Xp9YEp6HTt+t3cO5a8z+MeOgz2gAAA'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, create, ordered, and, unordered, list\"\n        title=\"React, create, ordered, and, unordered, list\"\n        src=\"/static/2aec5ce02a2f50ca226aab2a7382e464/a9b47/ordered-and-unordered-list.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/2aec5ce02a2f50ca226aab2a7382e464/81b7c/ordered-and-unordered-list.webp 158w,\n/static/2aec5ce02a2f50ca226aab2a7382e464/6ea66/ordered-and-unordered-list.webp 315w,\n/static/2aec5ce02a2f50ca226aab2a7382e464/a9b47/ordered-and-unordered-list.webp 390w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 390px) 100vw, 390px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to create ordered and unordered list in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"December 01, 2024","description":"Example of create ordered and unordered list in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to 